T: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"81\" height=\"130\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"113\" height=\"130\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">실험실 운영 </span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"146\" height=\"130\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">공동실험실습관</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"81\" height=\"130\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"left\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;2. 응시자격</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 국가공무원법 제33조(결격사유) 각호의 결격사유에 해당되지 아니한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 자격요건 : 이․공학계열 전문학사 학위 이상 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -2.9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">우대사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">전자현미경의 운영과 분석가능자 및&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학의 공동실험실습관 근무 경험자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3.&nbsp; 계약기간&nbsp; 및&nbsp; 보수<br></font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 계약기간 : 1년 단위로 계약</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 보수수준 : 연봉 13,500천원 정도(명절휴가비,성과상여금등 수당 포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 보수수준은 성과평가등급 등에 따라 다소 변동될 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 근무조건 : 4대보험 가입, 1년 이상 근무시 퇴직금 지급, 기타 복리후생 적용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 자세한 사항은 공고문을 참조하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
